  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the rustic charm of the countryside with this Jeminise Farmhouse Quilt Set, designed to bring a cozy and timeless look to your bedroom. Featuring classic patterns and soft, natural fabrics, this quilt set offers warmth and tradition, making it an ideal gift for loved ones.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Rustic Elegance:</strong> Adorn your bedroom with a farmhouse quilt featuring classic patterns and soft, natural fabrics for a cozy, timeless aesthetic.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Customization Options:</strong> Personalize your quilt by selecting your preferred size or adding pillowcases and a custom name.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> This farmhouse quilt is available in multiple sizes: Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86''), Full (80\"x90''), Queen (90\"x90''), and King (102\"x91'').</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> A perfect gift for Christmas, New Year, holidays, anniversaries, or birthdays for family members like mom, dad, sister, brother, grandma, grandpa, wife, husband, son, or daughter.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> This microfiber quilt is machine washable; simply wash separately in cold water and air dry without heat for fluffier results.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> The set includes 1 Quilt, with an option to add 2 Pillowcases.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Sets</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Dragonfly</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Farmhouse Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Patchwork Style Pattern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + 2 Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), King (102\"x91\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input for name</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
